--- OLD
      LDA math_basedamage               ; and +4 bonus to base damage
      CLC
      ADC #4
--- NEW
      ;  Increase Elemental and Type Bonus turns this constant into a load.
      ;  FFR writes the same byte -- IncreaseWeaponBonus pokes $326F5, which
      ;  is this bank's $A6F5, the very instruction below.  FFR's offsets are
      ;  headerless PRG, so bank $0C starts at $30000 and no 16-byte header
      ;  comes into it.  It still finds the byte by arithmetic on a constant,
      ;  which is what a patch anchored on the source text does not have to.
      ;  Vanilla is four, which against a strength-based damage of forty or
      ;  more is under a tenth and is why elemental weapons never felt like
      ;  anything.  The hit-chance bonus above is left alone -- forty on a
      ;  base of 168 already lands.
      LDA math_basedamage               ; and a bonus to base damage
      CLC
      ADC OPTD_ELEMDMG
